{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2nd ALBUM「君は0から1になれ」のMVが公開されましたがみなさん見てくれましたか〜？🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はねライブを意識したMVになっていて、たくさん花火とか特効とか豪華なセットの中踊らせて頂きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見てないよーって方、ぜひ1度でも見てくれたら嬉しいです😚"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもう見たよ！って方もぜひ毎日見てください😘"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のシンメはおみく🍣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘えんぼうさんだけどパフォーマンスはとってもカッコイイおみく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん褒めてくれるおみく。\n細いのにたくさん食べるおみく。\n最近色々話せて嬉しいし、立ち位置で迷子になってたらよくみーぱんさん！って呼んでくれます🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうね〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくにカメラ教えて欲しいんだー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅に行くのが今の目標です🦙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ499PJZWJAAT3NGXXCYXHHX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ499QKDMKX742Z7V3RHCHZ1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ499RN6VW0WKC4NRSVBF4HH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいる時にね、壁があって見えなかったからお互いに何してるかわからない状態で撮った写真がこちら😆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶよ〜🫶🏻💛🩵"}],"source":"archive"}